# Project Name

Mortgage Document Processing Multi-Agent System

# Business Flow

1. User sends a request with a loan number.
2. System calls an external vendor system named DMT.
3. DMT returns a list of employment and income documents.
4. Each document contains binary/base64 content.
5. System uploads each document to DocHub.
6. DocHub returns a unique document ID.
7. Store loan number and DocHub document ID in PostgreSQL.
8. Extract document content using Gemini.
9. Convert extracted information into structured JSON.
10. Store extraction JSON in PostgreSQL.
11. Return extracted JSON response to the caller.

